 "taglineEn": "Limewash, rattan, terracotta.",
 "descriptionEn": "Walls and ceiling read as one coat of limewash, with natural rattan and cane, warm light wood, sand linen, and sun-baked terracotta with olive. Stripes, arches and handmade ceramics, like a hotel on Mallorca, with no nautical clichés. Made for short-term rentals by the sea."
